==English==
{{was wotd|2015|October|27}}

===Etymology===
Borrowed from {{bor|en|fr|miscellanées}}, from {{der|en|la|miscellanea}}, from {{m|la|miscellus||mixed}}, from {{m|la|misceō||to mix}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|en|/mɪˈsɛ.lə.ni/}}
* {{a|US}} {{IPA|en|/ˈmɪ.səˌleɪ.ni/|/mɪˈsɛ.lə.ni/}}
* {{audio|en|en-au-miscellany.ogg|Audio (AU)}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# [[miscellaneous|Miscellaneous]] items.
# A collection of writings on various [[subject]]s or [[topic]]s; an [[anthology]].

